      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">واكأ عَلَى يَدَيْهِ</span></b>  <i>He leaned upon his hands,</i>
or <i>arms.</i> Mohammad was seen to do so when
he raised and extended his hands in supplication
to God. (IAth.)

